{"id":"856935e75395e5a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-foundation-abs.md","title":"Foundation Absoluteness","display":"thm-foundation-abs — Foundation Absoluteness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-foundation-abs","aliases":["58-thm-foundation-abs"],"display":"thm-foundation-abs — Foundation Absoluteness","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-ax-reg.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-foundation-abs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-foundation-abs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-foundation-abs — Foundation Absoluteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc7a9ab97950f0c4\" href=\"?note=bc7a9ab97950f0c4\" title=\"../batch18/58-ax-reg.md\">../batch18/58-ax-reg.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\">\\(M,N\\in V\\)</span> (set-sized membership structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Transitive}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Transitive}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (transitivity predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}foundation\\text{-}abs}\\vdash\n\\forall M,N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n&amp;M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\operatorname{Transitive}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{Transitive}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall A\\in M\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in A\\;(x\\cap A=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in N\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in A\\;(x\\cap A=\\varnothing))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}foundation\\text{-}abs}\\vdash\n\\forall M,N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n&amp;M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\operatorname{Transitive}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{Transitive}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall A\\in M\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in A\\;(x\\cap A=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in N\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in A\\;(x\\cap A=\\varnothing))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Foundation sentence is not <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Its agreement here is written with bounded internal quantifiers; no bare set is passed to the structure-sensitive satisfaction relation.</li>\n<li>Proper-class models require a class-theoretic satisfaction convention; the quantified statement above is deliberately restricted to set-sized transitive structures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-ax-reg.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc7a9ab97950f0c4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-ax-reg.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Transitive}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}foundation\\text{-}abs}\\vdash\n\\forall M,N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n&M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\operatorname{Transitive}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{Transitive}(N)\\\\\n&\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall A\\in M\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in A\\;(x\\cap A=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in N\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in A\\;(x\\cap A=\\varnothing))\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false}],"bytes":1246,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-foundation-abs.md|58-thm-foundation-abs]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["bc7a9ab97950f0c4","2d9fd66bae7ead5a"]}